---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' A legacy procedure called as "!name()", as adaml does: the "!" stays in
' front of the next line the procedure gives, here a line of a note.
!procedure mark()
!$marked = 1
!endprocedure
!procedure warn($who)
note over $who
!mark()
read this, $who
end note
!endprocedure
participant A
warn(A)
@enduml
